{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_title", "source_sha256": "4e7a6acff1928df1d6478f4f61fe2c055f8f3aedc81f3a43cec6a72baca35b4e", "ja": "死闘の果てに", "zh": "于死战之后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "81b73df05a69ea83f34123367a1f5ba10d867d87ee374e9d87eba69154f1c709", "ja": "かくして、アイドルヒーローズ達は見事に\nデストルドーの野望を打ち砕いた。\nしかし、この世の悪が潰える日はまだ遠い。\n戦え、アイドルヒーローズ！\n無敵の正義が全ての悪を打ち滅ぼす日まで！", "zh": "如此这般，偶像英雄联盟漂亮地粉碎了\n死欲的野心。但，离消灭世上所有邪恶\n仍相当遥远。奋战吧，偶像英雄联盟！\n直到无敌的正义将邪恶扫荡殆尽为止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "2a205f332a33534fd53fa48154e523c514d9ba3d95943a40ccd442d52ac346eb", "ja": "はぁ～、すごかったぁ～！\nみんな、とってもかっこよかったです♪", "zh": "呼～真是太精彩了～！\n大家都好帅气呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1001_101kot", "source_sha256": "40a1277ba52dcf249b2665d98753987775c5f4f70654152a638a3abf6d9d11e4", "ja": "ふふっ、そうね美咲ちゃん。なんだか私の中にも、\nキネティックパワーが眠っている気分になっちゃった♪", "zh": "呵呵，美咲说得没错。\n看完以后，感觉自己心中仿佛也沉睡着动能威力呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "103e3cec422c451186b7cfc2ee690347623d273542d77bae757a412ba669d8c0", "ja": "……これはつまり、ウチのアイドル達が出演した\n『アイドルヒーローズ』の試写会だったんですね。", "zh": "……原来你们是要带我来参加\n我们事务所偶像参与演出的《偶像英雄联盟》试映会啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1003_101kot", "source_sha256": "49240e3d84a0d1ec1b40ae7d7d0a42d1dc7ed80a56e2e352a589bedb096b2f28", "ja": "そうなんです♪　せっかくですからみんなで一緒に、\n劇場の大きなスクリーンで見ようって思って。", "zh": "是的♪我觉得机会难得，\n就想用剧场的大萤幕跟大家一起观赏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "64026865e22db954ee5ca5cd8a76bef08c82296d290843e91121ad39f2824239", "ja": "えへへ、アイドルのみんなも楽しめたみたいですね！\nまだ感想会に夢中みたい♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，偶像们好像也看得很开心！\n现在还很热烈地在交换感想呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "30708c39423e99c043f4856f254dbef8cee9eb815f5f3ab738ba5c085bbeaea0", "ja": "そうみたいですね。\nちょっと話してきます！", "zh": "似乎是这样没错。\n我去跟她们聊聊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "89262c25629ae2befbba1cabc820ce8d54dc870e309d6ebde0a9e2c16e9fcdf1", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまでした。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "057f4230e280467e12d139c9f21dbd96416c8453d79381ff24c510aed838765f", "ja": "……私、どうでしたか？\nちゃんと悪役らしく、演じられていましたか？", "zh": "……你觉得怎么样？\n我有演好那个反派角色吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a1f6970f9a1acc402e6ba387e00b16cf8597a8e734c2c95885bd9b22fd53396b", "ja": "琴葉、お疲れさま。すごくいい演技だったと思うよ。\n見ていて引き込まれたな。", "zh": "琴叶，辛苦了。\n我觉得你演得非常棒，让人忍不住看得入神呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "e880c1b5076b469c4d440f9bb13985630c8127d917b3a53e6e76146c1a21761b", "ja": "よかった……。自分でも、うまく役に入れたと思い\nます。彼女……コトハを、理解できた気がして……。", "zh": "太好了……我也觉得自己很投入在角色中。\n我好像可以明白她……死欲的琴叶在想什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "1191df168e28b3504b38719e6a0f6fae20ede672ac27f2532a4a1c492dcfb4ca", "ja": "あ、いえ、暴力がすべてだとか、\nそんな風に考えているわけじゃなくて！　ただ……。", "zh": "啊，别误会，我并不是赞同\n用暴力解决一切喔！只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "a0877b3b7eda11a98a2464a6cf3b571e1c24e0bd2519c9ff2d7fe0d2ac52420f", "ja": "孤独だったろうな、って……。", "zh": "觉得她好孤独……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d9905f2235d472e1a0f252d16effa8200ed7e35ac1e44c60d2f93595605c9318", "ja": "（悪役でも、きちんと解釈して……\nさすがだな、琴葉）", "zh": "（就算是反派角色，也非常用心去诠释……\n真不愧是琴叶。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "9a634c6e2890a1d34dbc2d6e1130fa04647437072731ceab05bb29f86bbe37fe", "ja": "……エミリーとコトハは倒されましたが、\n他のデストルドー達はどうなったんでしょう。", "zh": "……艾蜜莉和琴叶是被打败了，\n但其他死欲的下场又是如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "e591ce5c66e72da297a438aea2beadee3f3588878603897cbc252a38f8e41431", "ja": "あるいは……。", "zh": "还是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "e205b5aeb2f359a02ea1e0720c7e3af8370ecc3ed3658b80f7cf8c4f15e7e033", "ja": "デストルドー達の全容が明らかになるのは、\nまだまだこれからなのかもしれませんね……なんて。", "zh": "看来要弄清死欲一伙人的全貌，\n或许还需要好一段时间呢……我说说而已啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "40f20a556444e01ad4dee7eef7bd3eed8a9d881137c07c193c71cad0f296edcd", "ja": "あ、いたいた！　ねえねえ、{$P$}！\n最後まで、ちゃんと見てくれた！？", "zh": "啊，找到了找到了！欸欸，{$P$}！\n你有好好看到最后吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "56774722e09ff4a0802d33081bc530710a62ca5c4e824ab9f2c7dc32dec7f7c2", "ja": "おっ、海美と翼か。もちろん、ちゃんと見たよ。\nマイティセーラーズ、大活躍だったな！", "zh": "哦，是海美和翼啊。我当然有看完啰，\n『Mighty Sailors』表现得很精采呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "fa2d2f4f3dfae50674f7843190f91aa4a5e23a9adc2e09f835e0b22b2622facb", "ja": "うんうん、そうだよねっ！\n琴葉やみんなとすっごく頑張ったんだ！", "zh": "嗯嗯，就是说啊！\n琴叶和大家超级努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "997c1c79a6eb4f08ef6351ad59ab909bab3eed452b323b5e9036732704e7c1b4", "ja": "えへへ、わたしの役って守ってばっかり～って\n思ってたけど、けっこう目立ってましたよね？", "zh": "嘿嘿，本以为我的角色都在保护人～\n但其实还满出风头的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "20451996930a6c72601da32ddf117701ba785ee3242675b11e644714c69c87b3", "ja": "ああ、カッコよかったぞ。ところで、\nマイティセーラーズといえば……百合子は？", "zh": "是啊，超级帅气的。话说，\n讲到『Mighty Sailors』……百合子人呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "400b3483aa244584ca2ff650eb61f5795d586a84e2a2952efa31fc56c8a6c07c", "ja": "ゆりりんはね、まだ忙しいみたい！", "zh": "百合合她呀，好像还在忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "78fd80e701918b07feed2ff18fedc343416af907f1cb58de828acbf250fd24fa", "ja": "また役に入っちゃったみたいで、\n席に座ったまま、いろんな台詞を喋ってるみたい。", "zh": "她好像又入戏了，\n坐在位置上一直在念台词的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "cc9c4d16ea5b934775a23696d3ad20d47752c1feb393ab9729ced249b86f53c5", "ja": "そうか。上映中も、なんか声が漏れてたしな……。\nよし、そっとしておこう。", "zh": "原来，难怪刚才看电影时，好像有听到什么……\n好，我就别去打扰她了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "f9703996c8712e72fda208833c68af92adceb66fcd66e01556eee937c26f6897", "ja": "でもね、私も忙しいの！　\nまだ体がアツくて、すっごくムズムズして～！", "zh": "不过呢，我也是很忙的！\n感觉现在仍充满热血，完全静不下来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "99f23004f36873ba9c3bee587a7e16b481fd6f076b8f2b0f3fd559d9ce352917", "ja": "うう～、もうガマンできない～！\n{$P$}、ステージに上ってもいい！？", "zh": "呜呜～我已经忍不住了～！\n{$P$}，我可以上台吗！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "0ffb1cc9c0a9ed0131795947922b5f95e478b72ef86ccb0b740fa19feb8f5aca", "ja": "え？　いいけど……何をするんだ？", "zh": "咦？是可以……但你要做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "22136d199fd8a96bed5b337fe86b421beb7ba303145c553a106cc4620461ec79", "ja": "あっ、わかったかも♪\n海美さん、アレですよね～？", "zh": "啊，我好像知道了♪\n海美，你是要那个对吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "3b47578ae85a34cc8b2159760f438425bff92734aa230301e5157224bb0fafe9", "ja": "うんっ、アレだよバサバサ！\n二人で、思いっきり……歌っちゃおう！！", "zh": "嗯！就是飞飞想的那个！\n让我们一起……尽情高歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_015_salmon_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_015_salmon_02_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "758c8d1d96101611a51db0d4d4d8c01ea617d3ba7bbc1b455d2c34892eea24c5", "ja": "『インヴィンシブル・ジャスティス』！！", "zh": "『Invincible Justice』！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
